# V.6 Functionality Restoration into Current Architecture

## Problem
Admin panel integration broke the core Dashboard and Editor functions. The v.6 backup at `2 v.6 31.03.2026/` contains the **fully working** version with all functionality intact. The goal is to port that functionality into the current modern architecture (LoginGuard + DashboardLayout).

## Analysis: What V.6 Has That Current Version Lost

| Feature | V.6 (Working) | Current (Broken) |
|---------|---------------|-------------------|
| **LangCell** with V1/Proposed dual blocks | ✅ Full with drag-and-drop swap | ❌ Simplified single textarea |
| **Sayqallash** inline annotated text | ✅ Red strikethrough + green correction + ✓/✕ buttons per word | ❌ Simplified panel without inline view |
| **AI Yaxshilash** with expert pharma prompt | ✅ Full expert prompt with `<b>` tag support | ❌ Shortened generic prompt |
| **Block-level drag & drop** (swap V1↔Proposed between rows) | ✅ Working | ❌ Missing |
| **Row drag & drop** (reorder rows) | ✅ Working | ❌ Missing |
| **Auto-notes** (diff detection on save) | ✅ Called `/auto-notes` endpoint | ❌ Missing |
| **Insert row after** with sub-numbering | ✅ Working | ❌ Missing |
| **Delete row** with backend sync | ✅ Calls `/delete-row` endpoint | ❌ Client-only confirm |
| **RichContent** (images, tables, formulas) | ✅ Full parser | ❌ Missing |
| **Upload Dashboard** with Text ID + Specialist | ✅ Full with progress bar | ❌ Replaced with simple project list |
| **Backend Sayqallash prompt** | ✅ Detailed expert prompt with rules integration | ❌ Simplified generic check |
| **Backend improve-row** | ✅ Full expert pharma prompt | ❌ Shortened prompt |
| **Backend suggest-edits** | ✅ Full pharma expert prompt | ❌ Simplified |

## Proposed Changes

### Strategy
Replace the **current broken** frontend files with the **working v.6 functionality**, but adapted to work within the current `LoginGuard` + `DashboardLayout` architecture. The backend will be replaced with v.6's full endpoints plus the auth/admin features from the current version.

